<title>AUSTRALIA: Activists file complaint against Rio Tinto.</title>
<headline>Activists file complaint against Rio Tinto.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two conservation groups have lodged a formal complaint with the Australian Securities Commission (ASC) against Rio Tinto Ltd, claiming the company misled shareholders at its annual meeting in May.</p>
<p>The complaints relate to the Grasberg copper and gold mine in Indonesia. Rio Tinto Ltd/Plc has a 12 percent interest in the mine's operator Freeport-McMoRan Copper and Gold Inc.</p>
</text>
